  "bodyHash": "IXiDZAqw1XU=",
  "content": "<p>需要&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios-continuation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios  API</a></strong> 和 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modonomicon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modonomicon</a></strong>，但强烈建议安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>JEI</strong></a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Jade</span></strong></a>（<strong><em>极其推荐</em></strong>）</p><p>加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/HFT8AMzH8y\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/NauTec/MP_Katrina_NauTec_header.webp\" alt=\"\"></h1><p>Nautec 是一个探索海洋深处、发现强大且危险的新科技的模组。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/NauTec/MP_Katrina_NauTec_description.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p>要开始你的水下之旅，你必须找到一个位于暗海晶石遗迹下的海晶石水晶晶洞。这个遗迹中还有一个海洋催化剂，可以用来产生你的第一份能量。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1107394/description_49f94703-8933-4a7e-9ec4-58e70f48d36a.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1107394/description_20c4bce4-2f10-49ad-8812-f1a0aa9c24e1.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>由于海洋比原版更深，强烈建议制作潜水服，它可以消除水下的雾气效果。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1107394/description_2a1106e8-84fc-446a-88f3-6decc92ca3b2.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1107394/description_f862df9e-a6d5-46a7-8a08-6586e9a564a1.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>将海藻等燃料放入催化剂（需要漏斗）后，使用海洋之心激活它，催化剂就会产生能量并向15格范围内的任何方块发射激光束。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1107394/description_bd303235-9977-4ee8-9651-799245f36f75.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>向水晶发射激光束可以提高光束的纯度，从而使用激光进行物品转换。物品转换是通过向激光中投掷物品来实现的。</p><p>但要小心，它们可能会灼伤你！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1107394/description_553b36a7-19df-4e9c-ae4e-0617c09b598a.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>在激光下投掷铁会将其转化为海晶钢，从而解锁本模组的基础材料。</p><p>恭喜！你已完成前期准备，现在可以自行探索或借助指南书来游玩了。<strong>别忘了也要使用JEI哦！</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/NauTec/MP_Katrina_NauTec_features.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p>现在你已经解锁了海晶钢，可以开始建造诸如<strong>搅拌机</strong>之类的机器来深入深海化学，建造<strong>深海排水器</strong>来积累大量海水桶，并努力建造<strong>强化站</strong>来用各种强化剂强化你的身体。</p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wljonrf6o2k\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthepigcat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/NauTec/MP_Katrina_NauTec_promo.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
